{{!
    @template local_coursegen/template_space_picker_footer

    The footer of the modal of "Add space for an activity": a badge with how many activities are selected, what the
    selection makes, Cancel and Save.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-picker-badge" on how many are selected.
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-picker-summary" on what the selection makes.
    * data-action="cancel" and data-action="save" on the two buttons.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * none

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
<div class="tpl-sp-foot">
    <div class="tpl-sp-summary" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="tpl-sp-badge" data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-picker-badge" hidden></span>
        <span data-region="local_coursegen/template/space-picker-summary"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tpl-sp-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="cancel">{{#str}} cancel, core {{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="save" disabled>{{#str}} savechanges, core {{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
